meta {
  name: unsubscribe
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/public/leads/unsubscribe/:token/
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:path {
  token: 8f2c1d90-6b4a-4f77-9a1e-3d5c7b2e4a10
}

docs {
  ## API explanation
  One-click unsubscribe -- a legal requirement on the nurture emails. The token
  is `Lead.unsubscribe_token`, embedded in the footer of every marketing email.

  Marks the lead unsubscribed and cancels every still-pending email queued for
  them. Idempotent.

  ## API example response
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "You have been unsubscribed."
  }
}
